  "question": {
    "text": "The mean and variance of <math><mn>7</mn></math> observations are <math><mn>7</mn></math> and <math><mn>22</mn></math> respectively. If <math><mn>5</mn></math> of the observations are <math><mn>2,4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>12,14</mn></math>, then the remaining <math><mn>2</mn></math> observations are",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "6DPQM",
      "text": "<math><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>3</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "T4VM8",
      "text": "<math><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>5</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "hr3V9",
      "text": "<math><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "HSKzn",
      "text": "<math><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>2</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> Let <math><mi>x</mi></math> and <math><mi>y</mi></math> be remaining <math><mn>2</mn></math> observation<br />Mean <math><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math>&nbsp;...(i)<br />Variance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>22</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>12</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>14</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>7</mn></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>37</mn></math>&nbsp; ...(ii)<br />Now solving (i) and (ii),&nbsp;we get,</p><p>&nbsp;<math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math> or <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
